==Osmumten's Fang Icon Changes==
[[File:Miscellaneous Fixes (1).png|thumb|350px|center|''Inventory icon adjustment to the Standard Osmumten's Fang'']]

[[File:Miscellaneous Fixes (2).png|thumb|350px|center|''Inventory icon adjustment to the Ornamental Osmumten's Fang'']]

A few weeks ago, we tweaked Osmumten's Fang's model and special attack as part of the animation spring clean. This slight model adjustment ended up causing the Fang’s Inventory icon to appear smaller than before, and you weren't keen on it. We heard you loud and clear, and the art team has been working on adjusting its Inventory icon based on your feedback. You'll be pleased to hear that both the Standard and Ornamental Fang's Inventory icons now look bigger and clearer, as per your request!

Before we continue with what else has been fixed in this game update, we've got some exciting announcements to make!

==Araxxor Arrives Next Week!==
[[File:Miscellaneous Fixes (3).jpg|400px|center]]
The new Slayer boss, Araxxor, is crawling his way into Old School in a matter of days. This arachnoid menace is set to weave some serious trouble starting '''next Wednesday, August 28th!'''

For those who need to catch up, we first discussed this Araxyte from the deep dark swamps of Morytania in its [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/a=13/new-slayer-boss---the-araxyte?oldschool=1 poll blog.] You can also check our latest [https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/gielinor-gazette---july-2024?oldschool=1 Gazette] for a chat with Mod Arcane about Araxxor.

Stick around and keep your eyes open for this eight-legged terror... lest he creep up on you!

==Summer Summit 2024==
[[File:Miscellaneous Fixes (4).jpg|600px|center]]
Summer may be drawing to a close, but the Summer Summit 2024 is just around the corner!

Mark your calendars for '''September 7th, 8pm BST / 3pm ET / 12pm PT''' for all the exciting news the Summer Summit will bring!

Want to find out what we've been working on behind the scenes? Are you curious about the future content releases and what's in store for you? Make sure to tune in to [https://www.twitch.tv/oldschoolrs our official Twitch channel] on the day to get a first look at Old School's roadmap for the rest of the year and up until the next Summit at RuneFest in March.

===Watch Party over on Discord!===
As this year's Summer Summit airs, we'll be hosting a watch party in [http://discord.gg/OSRS our official Discord server]: You'll be able to watch it together with fellow 'Scapers, our lovely Chat Mods and some JMods in its dedicated channel, making predictions about what will happen at the Summer Summit and filling out a community-led bingo board!

We'll be giving more details about this community activity on Discord closer to the time, so join us on [http://discord.gg/OSRS Discord ]and stay tuned for more!

With these announcements out of the way, let's continue with some fixes we managed to sneak in while the team is busy preparing for Araxxor's launch next week…

